msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Stare"
msgstr "Mirar fijamente"

msgid "Stare passionately"
msgstr "Mirar con pasión"

msgid "Stare calmly"
msgstr "Mirar con calma"

msgid "Stare blankly"
msgstr "Mirar distraído"

msgid "About Taiga"
msgstr "Sobre Taiga"

msgid "Thanks for coming to the hospital"
msgstr "Gracias por ir al hospital"

msgid "Do your feet still hurt?"
msgstr "¿Todavía te duelen los pies?"

msgid "You had quite a long wish, huh?"
msgstr "Pediste un deseo bastante largo, ¿eh?"

msgid "About New Year's"
msgstr "Sobre Año Nuevo"

msgid "How was last year overall?"
msgstr "¿Cómo fue el año pasado en general?"

msgid "What do you want this year to be like?"
msgstr "¿Cómo quieres que sea este año?"

msgid "Where did those fireworks come from?"
msgstr "¿De dónde salieron esos fuegos artificiales?"

msgid "About Classmates"
msgstr "Sobre los compañeros"

msgid "Got any friends besides Kushieda?"
msgstr "¿Tienes amigos aparte de Kushieda?"

msgid "Got plans to hang out with anyone?"
msgstr "¿Tienes planes de salir con alguien?"

msgid "Everyone I've met so far seems nice"
msgstr "Todos los que conocí hasta ahora parecen agradables"

msgid "About Inko-chan"
msgstr "Sobre Inko-chan"

msgid "Isn't it cute?!"
msgstr "¡¿No es lindo?!"

msgid "It's kinda creepy"
msgstr "Es un poco espeluznante"

msgid "Shouldn't we give it a proper name?"
msgstr "¿No deberíamos ponerle un nombre apropiado?"

msgid "About Food"
msgstr "Sobre la comida"

msgid "I bet you're stuffed, huh"
msgstr "Seguro que estás llena, ¿eh?"

msgid "You don't care about anything but food"
msgstr "No te importa nada más que la comida"

msgid "The prices here are outrageous"
msgstr "Los precios aquí son exorbitantes"

msgid "--Let's Cheer Taiga Up!--"
msgstr "--¡Animemos a Taiga!--"

msgid "Taiga「......What's your problem?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué te pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha!? Nothing!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?! ¡Nada!」"

msgid "Taiga「............Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Tch.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't start coming into heat, you＿horndog!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No empieces a entrar＿en celo, pervertido!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What the hell!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Q-Qué demonios?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut it! Don't screw around!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡No hagas tonterías!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Alright! I get it, so calm down.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡E-Está bien! Ya entendí, cálmate.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Jum!!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Are you mocking me?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Te estás burlando de mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿D-De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Taiga「Like I care!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Como si me importara!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's going on......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué está pasando......?」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with that condescending＿attitude?! Don't act so important, you＿muppet!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué pasa con esa actitud tan＿condescendiente?! ¡No te creas＿importante, monigote!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not! I'm not!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Yo no hago eso! ¡No lo hago!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph, what's big is your body's＿audacity, you mongrel! Don't you come＿up with any shady schemes!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum, ¡tienes un descaro tan＿grande como tu cuerpo, perro!＿¡¡No trames nada raro!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not scheming...... Jesus Christ.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tramo nada...... Santo cielo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-Nothing......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-Nada......」"

msgid "Taiga「If you've got something to say, then＿spit it out!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si tienes algo que decir,＿¡¡suéltalo de una vez!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry! Ummm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón! Ehhh......」"

msgid "Taiga「So you don't have something to say?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿O sea que no tienes nada que decir?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I don't......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no tengo......」"

msgid "Taiga「What a dull expression.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Qué expresión tan sosa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......My face is dull?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Mi cara es sosa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I can think what I want.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Puedo pensar lo que quiera.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is your problem......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cuál es tu problema......?」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, ehm......」"

msgid "Taiga「What, are you just now getting choked＿up with gratitude?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué, apenas ahora se te hace un nudo＿en la garganta de gratitud?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I want a refund on my honest feelings.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Devuélveme mis sentimientos sinceros.」"

msgid "Taiga「That was pretty straightforward of＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso fue bastante directo de tu parte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, almost as straightforward as you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, casi tan directo como tú.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate.」"

msgid "Taiga「Have you no idea how much trouble＿you've been causing me ever since you＿were discharged?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No tienes idea de cuántos problemas＿me has causado desde que te＿dieron el alta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry, sorry. I really am grateful.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón, perdón. Sí lo agradezco.」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay, whatever. I accept your＿gratitude.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, como sea. Acepto tu gratitud.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, if I don't hurry and get you back＿to normal, me and Yacchan will be in＿trouble. I'm just doing my part.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si no te devuelvo a la normalidad,＿Yacchan y yo estaremos en aprietos.＿Solo hago mi parte.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, yeah, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, sí, supongo.」"

msgid "Taiga「What? Were you expecting something＿else?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¿Esperabas otra cosa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Nah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No.」"

msgid "Taiga「They hurt.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me duelen.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like I said, it's not something to get＿mad about, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como te dije, no es algo＿para enojarse, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「I had only just forgotten, but who had＿to go and remind me?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Justo acababa de olvidarlo, ¿y quién＿tuvo que venir a recordármelo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoops, my bad. Sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ups, culpa mía. Perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you want?! If you wanna go＿home, then why don't you just go!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué quieres?! Si te quieres ir a casa,＿¡¿por qué no te vas de una vez?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Why are you so upset?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿P-Por qué estás tan molesta?」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet! Why should I be pitied by＿someone like YOU!? Or treated like＿luggage!? Kiss my ass!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡¿Por qué alguien como＿TÚ me tendría lástima?! ¡¿O como＿un bulto?! ¡¡Vete!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not! I get it, so just calm down......＿On second thought, I don't get it at all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No es eso! Ya entendí, cálmate......＿Pensándolo bien, no entiendo nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not trying to get on your case here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy tratando de reprocharte nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「As if I'd let you get on my case over＿something like this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como si fuera a dejar que me＿reproches por algo así.」"

msgid "Taiga「Trying to say I'm GREEDY or＿something!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Intentas decir que soy＿CODICIOSA o algo así?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I wasn't trying to say that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No intentaba decir eso!」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't mistake me for a despicable＿penny-pincher like you!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡No me confundas con un tacaño＿despreciable como tú!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'm not, I'm not!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No lo soy, no lo soy!」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I'm sure your tiny brain couldn't＿begin to fathom my real intentions.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, tu diminuto cerebro ni entendería＿mis verdaderas intenciones.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Even if I wanted to try and imagine, I＿wouldn't have enough to go on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aunque quisiera intentar imaginarlo,＿no tendría pistas suficientes.」"

msgid "Taiga「Perhaps I wished for that insolent＿mouth of yours to be fixed?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Tal vez deseé que te arreglaran＿esa boca insolente que tienes?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I was wishing for something＿important.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, estaba deseando algo importante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, why are you making that face?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, ¿por qué pones esa cara?」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you care? Leave me alone.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué te importa? Déjame en paz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's your deal......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa a ti......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Wasn't yours longer? When I snuck a＿peek at you, you were still begging and＿pleading.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿El tuyo no fue más largo? Cuando te＿vi, seguías rogando y suplicando.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Begging and pleading\"? ......Oh, you＿mean when I was asking about the＿mold?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Rogando y suplicando\"? ......Ah, ¿te＿refieres a cuando pedía por el moho?」"

msgid "Taiga「Mold......? What about your memory?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Moho......? ¿Y qué hay de tu memoria?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, of course I wished for that! Of＿course!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, claro que deseé eso! ¡Por supuesto!」"

msgid "Taiga「It was awful!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Fue horrible!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, don't look so happy while you're＿insulting me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, no pongas cara tan feliz＿mientras me insultas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What was frustrating about it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué tuvo de frustrante?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, it wasn't all that bad, excluding＿the end of the year.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, no estuvo tan mal, excluyendo＿el fin de año.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I must have caused trouble right＿up to the last moment. No, I still am, I＿guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, debí causar problemas hasta el＿último momento. No, sigo haciéndolo.」"

msgid "Taiga「It is your top priority to remember＿what happened that night.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tu máxima prioridad es recordar＿qué pasó aquella noche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This conversation was supposed to be＿about you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Se suponía que esta conversación＿era sobre ti.」"

msgid "Taiga「Worry about yourself before you go＿worrying about other people.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Preocúpate por ti antes de andar＿preocupándote por los demás.」"

msgid "Taiga「It was so-so.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estuvo más o menos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Glad to hear it wasn't bad, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me alegra que no estuviera mal.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph. I knew you'd say something like＿that.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum. Sabía que dirías algo así.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not too sure.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No estoy muy segura.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Surely you must have some hopes for＿it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Seguro tienes alguna esperanza＿para este año?」"

msgid "Taiga「Drop it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Déjalo así.」"

msgid "Taiga「Who cares?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿A quién le importa?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What's the issue?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué problema hay?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not some carefree dreamer!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡No soy una soñadora despreocupada!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I know...... So pessimistic......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「L-Lo sé...... Qué pesimista......」"

msgid "Taiga「Why don't you try asking those people＿over there?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué no pruebas preguntarle＿a esa gente de allá?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I don't want to know that badly.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, tampoco quiero saberlo tanto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then shut your mouth.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces cierra la boca.」"

msgid "Taiga「Before you ask me, go search around＿somewhere! What else are your feet＿good for?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Antes de preguntarme, ve a＿buscar por ahí! ¡¿Para qué más＿te sirven los pies?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No...... Did you have to go that far?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No...... ¿Tenías que llegar tan lejos?」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't know why you'd ask me. Not like I＿would know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No sé por qué me preguntas.＿Tampoco es que yo lo sepa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, good point.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, buen punto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Christ, don't say anything and＿everything that comes to your mind.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por Dios, no digas lo primero＿que se te viene a la mente.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Argh, don't remind me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Agh, no me lo recuerdes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did something happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pasó algo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, kind of...... but it wasn't all that＿important, so just drop it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, algo así...... pero no fue＿tan importante, así que déjalo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Maybe we could've seen them if we'd＿gone to the observatory nearby.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tal vez los habríamos visto si＿hubiéramos ido al observatorio cercano.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Who would go to an observatory for＿Hatsumode?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Quién iría a un observatorio＿para el Hatsumode?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not saying I wish we had.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No digo que hubiera querido ir.」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you want with that＿information? It's none of your＿business, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Para qué quieres esa información?＿No es asunto tuyo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It could be my business.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Podría ser asunto mío.」"

msgid "Taiga「Not a single other person.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ni una sola persona más.」"

msgid "Taiga「Is Minorin not good enough!? Screw＿you!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Minorin no es suficiente?!＿¡¡Vete al diablo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, that wasn't what I meant.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No, no quise decir eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tch.」"

msgid "Taiga「Is this an interrogation?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Esto es un interrogatorio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I wouldn't go that far......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, tampoco llegaría a tanto......」"

msgid "Taiga「Whose fault is that!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Y de quién es la culpa de eso?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's my fault! Sorry!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Es mi culpa! ¡¡Perdón!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Carve it into your chest!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Grábatelo en el pecho!!」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever, good for you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea, bien por ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? What's up?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-Nothing! Not too interesting, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-Nada! No es muy interesante, supongo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then what was the point!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Entonces qué sentido tenía?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well, it's hard to respond to that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno, no sé cómo responder......」"

msgid "Taiga「If that's what you think, that's fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si eso es lo que piensas, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmmm, that sounded like some kinda＿hint.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm, eso sonó como algún＿tipo de indirecta.」"

msgid "Taiga「I dunno, I always thought maybe you're＿just too trusting of people...... Well, I＿don't think any of them are bad.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No sé, siempre pensé que confías＿demasiado en la gente...... No＿creo que ninguno sea malo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay. That's a bit of a relief.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien. Eso es un alivio.」"

msgid "Taiga「So you might conclude that I'm the＿most worthless out of everyone.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que podrías concluir que yo＿soy la más inútil de todos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I don't think that! Don't make that＿face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Yo no pienso eso! No pongas esa cara.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, you yourself are REALLY＿good-natured, you know. As they say,＿birds of a feather flock together.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú mismo eres MUY bonachón, ¿sabes?＿Como dicen, los pájaros del mismo＿plumaje vuelan juntos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you \"flocking\" with me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estás \"volando en bandada\" conmigo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Setting aside whether or not I'm a good＿person, I'm not sure I want to be in＿that \"flock\" in the first place.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Dejando de lado si soy buena persona o＿no, no quiero estar en esa \"bandada\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How can you say that awful stuff so＿easily?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo puedes decir cosas tan horribles＿con tanta facilidad?」"

msgid "Taiga「I admire your love for that Inko-chan of＿yours.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Admiro tu amor por ese Inko-chan tuyo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah. We got it as an egg when I＿was 11, and I haven't stopped＿showering it with love ever since!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, sí. Lo tuvimos desde que era＿un huevo a mis 11 años, ¡y no＿he dejado de quererlo!」"

msgid "Taiga「I hope you two will be happy together!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Espero que los dos sean felices juntos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me too!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Yo también!」"

msgid "Taiga「M-Maybe I can't compare with you, but＿even I think it's cute, you know!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「T-Tal vez no me compare contigo, pero＿¡hasta yo creo que es lindo, ¿sabes?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You too?!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Tú también?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Of course! Inko-chan is cute! But＿creepy though!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Claro! ¡Inko-chan es lindo!＿¡Pero espeluznante también!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, creepy though!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, sí, ¡espeluznante también!」"

msgid "Taiga「What a doting parent.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Qué padre tan consentidor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ugh......」"

msgid "Taiga「Seriously, if I turned out like Inko-chan＿I'd go crazy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「En serio, si terminara como Inko-chan＿me volvería loca.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it that bad?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Es tan malo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I think it's fine. What an eyesore,＿though.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Creo que está bien. Aunque＿es un horror a la vista.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you're saying it IS bad......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「O sea que dices que SÍ es malo......」"

msgid "Taiga「It's good that you can be objective＿about it, but you shouldn't say＿something like that. Mood killer!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Qué bueno que puedas ser objetivo,＿pero no deberías decir algo＿así. ¡Aguafiestas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't apologize to me. Go home and＿prostrate yourself before Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No te disculpes conmigo. Ve a casa＿y póstrate ante Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「A-Alright, I'll be sure to apologize.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien, le pediré perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't say that stuff out loud on＿purpose! It is creepy, though!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No digas esas cosas en voz alta a＿propósito! ¡¡Aunque sí es espeluznante!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「B-But you just admitted it yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Pero tú misma acabas de admitirlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! My new, nu, NUANCE was＿different! Use that rotten brain a little＿more and figure it out!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Mi ma, ma, MATIZ era＿diferente! ¡Usa ese cerebro podrido＿y descúbrelo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「M-My bad. I said something bad and I'm＿sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「C-Culpa mía. Dije algo malo y lo siento.」"

msgid "Taiga「After all this time?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Después de todo este tiempo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it too late?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Es demasiado tarde?」"

msgid "Taiga「Obviously! What are you saying?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Obviamente! ¿Qué estás diciendo?」"

msgid "Taiga「You should have given one from the＿start! Enough of your thoughtless,＿impulsive, carefree utopian whims!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Debiste ponerle uno desde el＿inicio! ¡Basta de tus caprichos＿utópicos e impulsivos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......O-Oh? What a perfectly sound＿argument.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿E-Eh? Qué argumento＿tan perfectamente lógico.」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you only just notice, you rotting＿half-wit?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Apenas te das cuenta,＿descerebrado podrido?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Before that, have you remembered＿WHY its name is \"Inko-chan\"?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Antes de eso, ¿ya recordaste POR＿QUÉ se llama \"Inko-chan\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, todavía no.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then shouldn't you be asking that＿first? Don't be so flippant.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Entonces no deberías preguntar eso＿primero? No seas tan frívolo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Naming something isn't that easy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Poner un nombre no es tan fácil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't just say \"oh\"......」"
msgstr "Taiga「No digas solo \"eh\"......」"

msgid "Taiga「Inko-chan is Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Inko-chan es Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, uhh, I guess so.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eh, supongo que sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「A non-Inko-chan would be less＿Inko-chan and more un-Inko-chan-like＿and therefore not Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Un no-Inko-chan sería menos＿Inko-chan y más anti-Inko-chan,＿y no sería Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............Alright already! Inko-chan is＿definitely Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............¡Está bien, ya entendí!＿¡Inko-chan es sin duda Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup, to the gills～!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sí, hasta el tope～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And yet you look so happy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y aun así te ves tan feliz.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just admit that the souvenirs are for＿you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo admite que los recuerdos＿son para ti.」"

msgid "Taiga「Damn straight. Fufu.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por supuesto. Juju.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm pretty envious of competitive＿eaters right about now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora mismo les tengo mucha envidia＿a los que compiten comiendo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Eat any more and you'll just bankrupt＿the family finances.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si comes más, vas a llevar a la quiebra＿las finanzas familiares.」"

msgid "Taiga「If that happened, wouldn't it be your＿chance to save the day?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si eso pasara, ¿no sería tu oportunidad＿de salvar el día?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I guess you're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, supongo que tienes razón.」"

msgid "Taiga「Heaven on earth.」"
msgstr "Taiga「El cielo en la tierra.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's quite a statement.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, vaya declaración.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm glad I can eat so much!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué alegría poder comer tanto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not the most efficient mileage, per＿se......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tampoco es el mejor rendimiento＿que digamos......」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, true...... Ryuuji, get me a Ramune.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, cierto...... Ryuuji, dame un Ramune.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Drinks still count...... And they don't sell＿them when it's cold as a witch's tit out＿here. This ain't a summer festival.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Las bebidas también cuentan......＿Y no venden eso con este frío.＿No es festival de verano.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Well, of course. I was just testing＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, claro. Solo te＿estaba poniendo a prueba.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Beg your pardon?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo dices?」"

msgid "Taiga「Never you mind.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No importa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you think it would be fun outside in＿the cold?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Pensaste que sería divertido＿estar afuera con este frío?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This is for Hatsumode.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esto es por el Hatsumode.」"

msgid "Taiga「I prayed like I was supposed to.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Recé como debía hacerlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, duh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pues claro.」"

msgid "Taiga「If that's how you feel, then don't buy＿anything.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si piensas así, entonces＿no compres nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But that's no fun.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero eso no es divertido.」"

msgid "Taiga「Likewise, talking to you is no fun!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Hablar contigo tampoco es divertido!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón.」"

msgid "Taiga「What? You trying to say I'm stupid for＿buying and enjoying everything!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¡¿Intentas decir que soy tonta＿por comprar y disfrutar de todo?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, that wasn't what I......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No, eso no era lo que yo......」"

msgid "Taiga「SAY IT! You stingy Zeni Geba＿moneyworm!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡DILO! ¡Gusano tacaño＿igual que Zeni Geba!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Sorry! My bad!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Perdón! ¡Culpa mía!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tch.」"

